": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "1.png", "id": "1257169869257043", "uri": "https://scontent-qro1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820648_1257169872590376_3704678405841889113_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-q4DQODYWHAQ7kNvwGfxN1l&_nc_oc=AdpHyG7ZTHUnKsxpbPtzEHjZoJjCnv0cx9N8hxQmfzDlxejyOptRLxHFsCOhKJXyh_k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQE5nzUZAHPTgYPlOBB7Paz2OzOkYGoLnrjjcrOdT0C26w&oe=6A9413BC"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "1593559845364804", "uri": "https://scontent-qro1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499304305_1593559848698137_5006246285640620137_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EowVcmz9WmwQ7kNvwEia2YB&_nc_oc=AdoY15-4mCg086OUR2InaPfoaCh9a8OCXMNMgOUAeeQjT6dRG9daLUVo8gj5RcZY6-8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEdJjnFf2_ZVT9DqS5DWJSZElSRE2V805srB_cVio3TQQ&oe=6A942CEC"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "2157379071374193", "uri": "https://scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828842_2157379074707526_1945640424716555186_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nnJptwwWvBsQ7kNvwH-JB-T&_nc_oc=AdptAOAMrrXj29UZScEzVwg6K14NtwrQnQJ9C6ZWFgebiGsmweGyh251gpORHXgQTQ4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQG1U6qhiMQBuSzeQaOW3g8f7ke4Abk7BB-ktHrX7SZ_7w&oe=6A9410B0"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "1009406078036722", "uri": "https://scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819396_1009406081370055_390968474089104374_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xLQB316qR5cQ7kNvwFQUm8_&_nc_oc=Ado6Z8bNXo3LWlG1eRRmvhjcZtH2NNr-EEup7N4BIUpXgJ3tA-n7hzPebakfAGw2H2U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGwbZzxEKtl-xtFs5kLkCcyG1JIlwCF-0XDVg1qw6MdsA&oe=6A94214D"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "1482291982937646", "uri": "https://scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499300636_1482291986270979_3477486190926684877_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=i92rovSgV_8Q7kNvwHeJOJn&_nc_oc=Ado0H2Ii8szBEwRL1awrSNUFZp1FEE6Hjbbs76TGv3NJZy6t6VX8YQ-7smNyJuRQCMY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGNOwSPzm9rtQqsK26ooa5og1mVXJQsB41PF-O-dvTBYQ&oe=6A942B38"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "2D Calendar", "keywords": ["calendar", "daily", "date"], "long_description": "This calendar is designed to be easy to use from Meta Quest and has many features for easy use.\n\n## Main Calendar Features\n\n### 1. Calendar View\n- Tap any day to add an event\n- Long press any day to quickly add an event\n- Days with events show visual indicators\n- Monthly navigation with smooth transitions\n- \"Go to today\" quick navigation button\n- Interactive event details popup when clicking dates with events\n\n### 2. Add Events\n- Main floating action button (+) to add events\n- Comprehensive form with required field validation\n- Event title (mandatory field)\n- Auto-selected date based on calendar selection\n- Optional event description\n- Optional time picker with 12/24-hour format support\n- Automatic database saving\n\n### 3. View All Events\n- Secondary floating action button (list icon) to view all events\n- Chronologically ordered event list\n- Complete event information display with icons\n- Total events counter\n- Empty state message when no events exist\n- Rich formatting with time and date information\n\n### 4. Event Management\n- Delete events with confirmation dialog\n- Automatic view updates after changes\n- Date-specific event viewing (AlertDialog showing all events for selected date)\n- Confirmation messages for all actions\n- Real-time calendar indicator updates\n- Persistent storage across app sessions\n", "short_description": "Calendar with daily log"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1ZCXNCsBn5eclu-NVLLD8u10iDNwaaBsQ7XmLx0OAy2Y/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Pop Software Developer", "support_websi